{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight against massive hordes of relentless flesh-hungry zombies in this top-down, 2D arcade action shooter. Experience bite-sized, highly replayable arcade action as you exterminate the undead in bloody combat across unique and challenging arena-style levels. Want to  jump straight in and start killing thousands of zombies in a scary zombie apocalypse? This is the game for you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992910/extras/79e8bdcbbac2964e66fa7b4f84674257.poster.avif?t=1761890733\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992910/extras/79e8bdcbbac2964e66fa7b4f84674257.webm?t=1761890733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992910/extras/79e8bdcbbac2964e66fa7b4f84674257.mp4?t=1761890733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Face hundreds of zombies on-screen at once,\u00a0</i></strong>and thousands over the course of each level, with 5 different distinct enemy types to encounter and kill. You\u2019ll encounter massive zombies, fast ones, and more\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Aggressively blast and shoot hordes of zombies with your choice of 3 different zombie-slaughtering vehicles</i></strong>, each with their own unique playstyles. Shoot in multiple different directions at once with unique controls as you unleash a barrage of explosive tank shells and thousands of bullets at the undead masses running at you. You can fire forward and to the side, or behind you, or every direction at once, the options are endless, just like the undead hordes before you hungry for flesh\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Interact with everything on screen\u00a0</i></strong>as you blow zombies to pieces, in the process sending walls, traffic barriers, cars, and more flying around in extremely destructive  gameplay. If machine guns and cannons don\u2019t work, try bulldozing through everything at full speed in your tank\u2026\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Step into a world overrun with the undead in a narrative told across 7 unique levels</i></strong>, with each level consisting of a unique arena to fight the undead in and designed to be replayable, surviving and holding out until the timer finally expires. If the level ends and there\u2019s blood all over the screen and your character is screaming and being eaten alive by zombies, you most likely did something wrong\u2026\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Feel the crumbling world around you brought to life with moody, atmospheric environments</i></strong>, featuring hand-drawn art, custom-created sounds and music, and terrifying, bloody undead hordes tireless in their hunger for flesh. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Discover a lore page, stats to track your total zombies killed, and a bonus unlockable level</i></strong> featuring tower defense gameplay.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udddf\ud83e\udddf\ud83e\udddf\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83e\udddf\ud83e\udddf\ud83e\udddf\ud83e\udddf\ud83e\udddf\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2640\ufe0f